  "notes": "NOTES\nCapo 2, sounds in A (matches record). Play the G shapes as written.\nAnchor trick: ring + pinky stay on 3rd fret of B and e strings for the\nwhole song. G 320033, Cadd9 x32033, G/B x20033, G/D xx0033.\nOnly the bass moves. That drone is the sound, protect it.\nDsus to D is the one moment the anchor lifts, make it count on \"magnified.\"\nEm = Em7 022033 to keep the anchor. C = Cadd9, don't bother with plain C.\n",
